        "ggcnpRd51XE_text": "Engineered for the Swing That Wins More Holes",
        "ggiOf_H0zOG_text": "<p>The included elbow corrector keeps your lead arm connected through impact — fixing the most common swing fault without a single lesson.</p>",
        "ggndsTEP8yc_text": "<p>Arm Band That Kills Chicken Wing</p>",
        "ggrs9_0T49R_text": "<p>The spring-loaded mechanism extends at the exact moment of correct release — and clicks audibly. No guessing. You hear it when you get it right.</p>"
